// Diagnostic view of a live exception, not an immutable snapshot or an ownership transfer.
// Source references borrow the instance's storage; GetRootException may return a mutable view.
// Clone lifetime/ownership must be defined by its implementation; framework exceptions are auto-disposed.
INTERFACE IReadOnlyException EXTENDS IObject, ICloneable]]></Declaration>
